\",\"staleTime\":\"$b\",\"varyParams\":\"$10\"}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@13\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@14\"}\n26:I[38437,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"Image\"]\n2b:I[90484,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2c:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2e:I[90484,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n2f:I[90484,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n30:I[86869,[],\"IconMark\"]\n31:I[57121,[],\"\"]\n32:I[74581,[],\"\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n6:[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]\n7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"blockquote\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-10 border-l-2 border-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/[0.06] px-6 py-2 font-heading text-xl leading-8 text-white sm:px-8\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"TL;DR:\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Only 7 of 24 major AI training data deals from 2020–2025 compensate original creators — the rest channel value to intermediaries. Roughly 99% of the world's data remains \\\"dark\\\" — inaccessible, unlicensed, or uneconomical to bring to market. The Content ARCs framework (Authenticity, Rights, Compensation) defines what a functional data rights system must do but lacks an autonomous settlement layer. Stablecoin settlement on an HTTP-native agentic payment protocol makes Compensation operational: instant, sub-cent, programmable payouts to rightsholders. DigiRobotics composes Content ARCs with stablecoin-native settlement to build the compensation loop.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"The Scale of the Crisis\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A recent research paper from a leading open data lab establishes data economics as a coherent field and documents the structural failures of the current market. The findings are stark.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"AI labs currently use less than 0.01% of the world's available data. Roughly 99% remains as \\\"dark data\\\" — inaccessible, unlicensed, or uneconomical to bring to market. Researchers face a \\\"data wall\\\" around 15 trillion tokens of public internet text, and performance improves as a power law in dataset size with exponents typically between 0.3 and 0.5 — meaning every doubling of data produces sublinear but predictable gains.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The deal landscape is equally concentrated. Of 24 major AI training data deals documented from 2020 to 2025, only 7 compensate the original creator of the data. The rest channel value to intermediaries — publishers, platforms, aggregators — while the humans whose activity generated the data see nothing. Specific deals illustrate the scale: a major news publisher received over $250 million over five years; a major social platform received $60 million per year; a major magazine publisher received $16 million per year. Indie music tracks sell for €0.30 to €2 per track. Video footage sells for $1 to $4 per minute. In nearly every case, the original creator — the journalist, the musician, the videographer, the person whose first-person activity was recorded — is excluded from the transaction.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"The Architecture for Fixing It\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A separate paper from a leading academic research center proposes a structural fix. The Content ARCs framework — Authenticity, Rights, Compensation — defines three interconnected phases that any functional data rights system must deliver:\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L15\",\"\\n\",\"$L16\",\"\\n\",\"$L17\",\"\\n\",\"$L18\",\"\\n\",\"$L19\",\"\\n\",\"$L1a\",\"\\n\",\"$L1b\",\"\\n\",\"$L1c\",\"\\n\",\"$L1d\",\"\\n\",\"$L1e\",\"\\n\",\"$L1f\",\"\\n\",\"$L20\",\"\\n\",\"$L21\",\"\\n\",\"$L22\",\"\\n\",\"$L23\",\"\\n\",\"$L24\"],\"$L25\"]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"src\":\"/digirobotics/brand/digirobotics-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"DigiRobotics.xyz\",\"width\":210,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-auto w-[190px]\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-white/60\",\"children\":\"Egocentric data for robotics training.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Footer navigation\",\"className\":\"flex max-w-2xl flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contributor\",{\"href\":\"/#contributors\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contributor\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Marketplace\",{\"href\":\"/#marketplace\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Marketplace\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Custom Data\",{\"href\":\"/#custom-data\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Custom Data\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Capture Gear\",{\"href\":\"/gear\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Capture Gear\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Articles\",{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Agent Demo\",{\"href\":\"/agent-demo\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Agent Demo\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Privacy & Terms\",{\"href\":\"/#privacy-note\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Privacy & Terms\"}],\"$L27\"]}]]}],\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\"]}]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@2d\"}]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"The AI Data Compensation Crisis — DigiRobotics\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Only 7 of 24 major AI training data deals from 2020–2025 compensate original creators. Combining the Content ARCs rights framework with autonomous stablecoin settlement closes the loop — every access pays the rightsholder instantly.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.webmanifest\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"The AI Data Compensation Crisis\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Only 7 of 24 major AI training data deals from 2020–2025 compensate original creators. Combining the Content ARCs rights framework with autonomous stablecoin settlement closes the loop — every access pays the rightsholder instantly.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"The AI Data Compensation Crisis\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"article:modified_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"The AI Data Compensation Crisis\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Only 7 of 24 major AI training data deals from 2020–2025 compensate original creators. Combining the Content ARCs rights framework with autonomous stablecoin settlement closes the loop — every access pays the rightsholder instantly.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/the-ai-data-compensation-crisis-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"$L30\",\"20\",{}]]}]}]}],null]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{}]}]]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{}]}]]}]\n14:true\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Authenticity\"}],\" establishes identity and verifies the provenance of digital assets, using open standards for content provenance metadata.\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Rights\"}],\" allows rightsholders to assert ownership and create machine-readable digital contracts that license assets under programmable terms.\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Compensation\"}],\" enables rightsholders to extract value the moment a licensee exercises a granted license — programmatically, without manual invoicing.\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The framework combines open standards — including content provenance specifications, opt-out metadata flags, and machine-readable rights expression languages — with decentralized ledger technologies that act as tamper-evident registries of ownership and license grants. The paper analyzes seven existing decentralized rights protocols and four commercial rights platforms, mapping each to the Content ARCs phases. The conclusion: no single open standard or system yet delivers fully across all three phases.\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The technical barriers are real. Registry establishment at planetary scale is unsolved. Identity representation remains primitive — most decentralized systems leverage wallet addresses as identifiers rather than more sophisticated frameworks. Legislative uncertainty persists across jurisdictions. And content discovery mechanisms for licensed assets are nascent. The probability of collision in a 64-bit content identifier reaches 50% at only 5 billion assets — a fundamental scale constraint given that generative AI training datasets routinely include billions of assets.\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Why Architecture Alone Isn't Enough\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The Content ARCs framework defines what a functional data rights system must do. It does not specify how compensation actually settles when a license is exercised. That gap is the difference between a framework and an operational marketplace.\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Consider the unit economics. A generative AI training corpus of billions of assets, licensed under programmable terms, with compensation due the moment each asset is accessed by an autonomous agent, generates transaction volumes that no legacy rail can handle. Per-unit pricing at €0.30 to €2 per track, settled across millions of accesses per day, requires sub-cent fees and sub-second finality. Aggregate licensing at $250 million over five years, distributed back to thousands of original creators proportionally, requires programmable conditionality and atomic settlement. The Content ARCs Compensation phase implicitly assumes a settlement layer that does not yet exist in the legacy financial stack.\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"That settlement layer is what autonomous stablecoin payment infrastructure provides. The same HTTP-native agentic payment protocol that processes API micropayments for AI agents can settle a creator's royalty the moment their asset is consumed. The same stablecoin settlement that delivers sub-second finality for autonomous commerce can route a compensation payment to a journalist, a musician, or a first-person data contributor within seconds of license exercise. The same five-dimension policy engine that governs agentic spending can enforce the rights, caps, and counterparty verification that a Content ARCs deployment requires.\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The data economics paper identifies four open problems: measuring context-dependent value, balancing governance with privacy, estimating data's contribution to production, and designing mechanisms for heterogeneous compositional goods. The Content ARCs paper identifies the technical barriers to operationalizing rights and compensation. The missing piece that connects both is autonomous settlement at the scale, speed, and cost the data economy demands.\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics is the world's first stablecoin-native marketplace for agentic commerce in real-world robotics data — purpose-built to operationalize the Content ARCs framework on top of autonomous stablecoin settlement.\"}]\n33:T49f,Our platform composes all three Content ARCs phases with the settlement layer that makes them operational. For Authenticity, wallet-signed consent, verifiable provenance metadata, and onchain registration of every contributed dataset establish identity and asset provenance at the point of capture. For Rights, tokenized datasets carry programmable license terms expressed in machine-readable rights languages, allowing rightsholders to assert ownership and define usage terms that autonomous agents can read and respect. For Compensation, settlement runs over an HTTP-native agentic payment protocol in USDG stablecoins on a high-performance Layer-2 network, paying contributors the instant their data is consumed by an AI agent or robotics lab. No invoices, no batch payouts, no 30-day settlement windows. The Five-Dimension Policy Engine enforces spending limits, counterparty allowlists, transaction type restrictions, time-based controls, and escalation thresholds on every transaction. And mobile-application-driven submission with multi-stage QA, automatic anonymization, and structured metadata ensures every dataset meets the rigor that production-scale AI training demands.21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"$33\"}]\n22:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-15\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"By composing the Content ARCs architecture directly with autonomous stablecoin settlement, DigiRobotics turns the framework from an aspiration into infrastructure. The 71% of major data deals that currently exclude original creators become structurally impossible — every access settles programmatically to the rightsholder of record. The 99% of the world's data that remains dark becomes economically reachable, because the marginal cost of compensating a contributor approaches zero when the settlement rail itself costs near zero and settles instantly.\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Start Building With Us\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-16\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"If you create first-person data — video, audio, sensor streams, physical task demonstrations — your work can train the next generation of AI systems and earn you USDG the moment it is consumed. AI labs and agent developers can procure programmatically licensed, authenticity-verified data with instant settlement and verifiable provenance. Join the DigiRobotics marketplace and help close the compensation loop that the data economy has been missing.\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" Return to the archive\"]}]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contact Us\",{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy-note\",\"className\":\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\"}]]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"x\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 6 6 18\",\"key\":\"1bl5f8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m6 6 12 12\",\"key\":\"d8bk6v\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"mail\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\",\"key\":\"132q7q\"}],[\"rect\",{\"x\":\"2\",\"y\":\"4\",\"width\":\"20\",\"height\":\"16\",\"rx\":\"2\",\"key\":\"izxlao\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\",\"children\":\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\"}]\n2d:null\nb:300\nb:C\n13:0\nd:\"$undefined\"\nf:\"$undefined\"\n12:\"$undefined\"\na:\"$undefined\"\n"}}